The packet passed to packet capture programs may not have a valid check=
sum
if you have checksum offload configured on the device.  What kind of ha=
rdware
do you have on sender and receiver?  Try disabling checksum offload wit=
h
ethtool.

If you are getting bad UDP checksums then the counters in 'netstat -s'
will be increasing.
